flowchart TD
    Start([Employee Submits Ticket]) --> GenerateCode[Generate Sequential Code TCK-YYYY-NNNN]
    GenerateCode --> CalcDueAt[Calculate SLA dueAt: now + PRIORITY_HOURS]
    CalcDueAt --> CreateOpen[Save Status: OPEN, createdBy: empId]
    CreateOpen --> OpenQueue[(Open Tickets Queue)]

    OpenQueue --> StaffTriage[Support Staff Triages Ticket]
    StaffTriage --> AssignStaff{Assign Technician?}
    
    AssignStaff -- Yes --> SetAssigned[Update assignedTo & Status: IN_PROGRESS]
    SetAssigned --> AuditAssign[Audit: TICKET_ASSIGN]
    AuditAssign --> InProgressState[(Ticket In Progress)]

    InProgressState --> Discuss[Two-Way Discussion Comments Thread]
    Discuss --> AuditComment[Audit: TICKET_COMMENT]
    AuditComment --> InProgressState

    InProgressState --> ResolveAction[Support Solves Issue & Submits Resolution]
    ResolveAction --> CheckNote{Resolution Note >= 5 Chars?}
    
    CheckNote -- No --> NoteError[Reject Transition: Note Required] --> InProgressState
    
    CheckNote -- Yes --> SetResolved[Update Status: RESOLVED, resolvedAt: now]
    SetResolved --> AuditResolved[Audit: TICKET_STATUS from IN_PROGRESS to RESOLVED]
    AuditResolved --> ResolvedState[(Ticket Resolved)]

    ResolvedState --> EmpFeedback{Employee Satisfied with Solution?}
    
    EmpFeedback -- No: Issue Persists --> ReopenTicket[Employee Reopens Ticket]
    ReopenTicket --> ClearResolved[Clear resolvedAt & Status: IN_PROGRESS]
    ClearResolved --> AuditReopen[Audit: TICKET_STATUS Reopened]
    AuditReopen --> InProgressState

    EmpFeedback -- Yes: Problem Solved --> StaffClose[Support / Admin Closes Ticket]
    StaffClose --> SetClosed[Update Status: CLOSED, closedAt: now]
    SetClosed --> AuditClosed[Audit: TICKET_STATUS from RESOLVED to CLOSED]
    AuditClosed --> EndState([Immutable Archived Ticket])
